Shadowsocks (Stealtify's own implementation — no GPL)
================================================================================

  Stealtify implements the Shadowsocks (SIP004 AEAD) client itself
  (gostengine/ssaead.go), using only the Go standard library and
  golang.org/x/crypto (BSD-3-Clause). It does NOT use the GPL-3.0 libraries
  github.com/sagernet/sing / github.com/sagernet/sing-shadowsocks.

